<%--
_Sys_Portal_Users_Action - the Portal Users screen: every client-portal user on the install,
across every site, in one grid (_Sys_Portal_Users_DataGrid, grid key "portal_users"). A row
opens the portal user (_Sys_Portal_User_View_Action): its facts, live portal sessions,
portal sign-in history and security state.
--%>
<Define:_Sys_Portal_Users_Action>
<_Sys_Page_Scaffold>
    <Slot:main>
        <_Sys_Portal_Users_DataGrid />
    </Slot:main>
</_Sys_Page_Scaffold>
</Define:_Sys_Portal_Users_Action>
